   "source": [
    "# 🎙️ Prime Speaker Extractor\n",
    "Extracts individual voice clips of a specific person from multiple YouTube videos.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Pipeline:** YouTube → Download Audio → Diarize Speakers → Match Reference Voice → Export Clips\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "### Before running:\n",
    "1. Set runtime to **GPU**: `Runtime > Change runtime type > T4 GPU`\n",
    "2. Get a free [HuggingFace token](https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens)\n",
    "3. Accept model terms at: https://hf.co/pyannote/speaker-diarization-3.1\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# ── CELL 1: Install dependencies ──────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "!pip install -q yt-dlp pyannote.audio resemblyzer pydub\n",
    "!pip install -q torch torchaudio --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu118\n",
    "print('✅ Dependencies installed')"
   ],
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# ── CELL 2: Mount Google Drive (to save clips persistently) ───────────────────\n",
    "from google.colab import drive\n",
    "drive.mount('/content/drive')\n",
